:history

    0.13.0.152-dev - 2026/05/31 (823ab6c5) [fix/mcp-tool-binding-test-isolation]
        :brief strict acceptance 报告写入顶层项目版本并纳入当前性校验
        :test
            - test(acceptance): strict-acceptance Write-Report 增加 Project version 头，报告打开后即可判断证据所属版本
            - test(audit): autonomous-product-audit 优先校验 strict 报告 Project version 头，并继续校验 benchmark project_version 明细
            - test(audit): full workspace 报告缺 Project version 头或头版本陈旧时降级为 warn，不再作为当前 full evidence
            - report(strict): 重新运行 focused strict acceptance，刷新 crawler、HF、Preview browser、topic/code/final PaperRun benchmark 证据到 0.13.0.152-dev
            - report(audit): autonomous product audit 确认 strict live header 与 benchmark 明细均匹配当前版本
        :changelog
            - docs(changelog): 0.13.0.151 开发历史移入 docs/changelog/v0/0.13.0.151.CHANGELOG
        :checks
            - targeted tests: packages/opencode strict-acceptance.test
            - strict acceptance: scripts/strict-acceptance.ps1 -CheckTimeoutSeconds 900
            - audit: scripts/autonomous-product-audit.ps1 -AllowActiveTask
